<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">sparks</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conviction Sparks</ansi> spell (cast as <ansi fg="command">sparks</ansi>) scatters a storm of
crystallized belief shards that lash every enemy in the room. A
fast-casting area spell suited for disrupting groups of weaker foes,
though its damage per target is modest compared to focused attacks.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast sparks</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Area
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 4
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 75
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — armor deflects the conviction shards
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Light damage to all enemies in the room

